	qx, qy, qz, qw) and size. `clips` hold, per joint, the keys of what it
	animates: `times` and `values` (3 a key for pos and scale, 4 for rot).
	Shaped as `Shared/Util/ModelClip`'s Model; played by `Fx/ModelAnimator`.
]]

